<title>HONG KONG: Moulin interim profit surges 61.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Moulin interim profit surges 61.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   14.16  vs 9.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0    vs 3.2</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    61.81  vs 38.23</p>
<p>Turnover			 246.05 vs 166.09</p>
<p>    Company name		 Moulin International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 15-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   March 4</p>
<p>NOTE - Moulin International is an optical products maker.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
